# Repository-wide ignores. Each app keeps its own .gitignore (apps/sino-api, apps/sino-web).

# OAuth client files downloaded from the Google Cloud console hold the client secret in plain text.
# The secret belongs in apps/sino-api/.env only.
client_secret*.json

# Memory a review agent writes next to an app it reviewed (`apps/sino-web`, `apps/sino-zalo`): local to this
# machine, not part of the project. The rest of `.claude/` is tracked on purpose (the OpenSpec commands and
# skills at the root, the app agents in `.claude/agents/`), so only this one folder is ignored, at any depth.
**/.claude/agent-memory/
